    <title>Mit6.5840 Lab3</title>
    <link href="/2026/06/10/Mit6.5840%20Lab3/"/>
    <url>/2026/06/10/Mit6.5840%20Lab3/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/../images/Pasted%20image%2020260610100826.png"></p><h2 id="总览"><a href="#总览" class="headerlink" title="总览"></a>总览</h2><p>先梳理清楚raft算法的大致逻辑</p><p>所有的节点都为三个状态其中一个，follow，candidate，leader。所以从这三个节点分别分析，后续再做解耦和逻辑合并。</p><p><strong>follow</strong>：每个节点都有一个随机时间假定为time_1用来进行选举，如果超时未收到leader的心跳，或者其他candidate的请求投票。则自身状态变为candidate</p><p><strong>candidate</strong>：向其他节点发送投票请求。根据论文描述，如果发送请求后，发现自身term小于被请求节点的term，这时会觉得自己掉队了，变为follow。请求投票结束后获得大部分选票，则变成leader</p><p><strong>leader</strong>：leader每隔一段时间向其他节点发送心跳信号，保证自己存活。心跳这里需要重点分析，如果领导者的term小于这个节点，那么leader变为follow，如果等于，相安无事。如果大于，则需要更新被发送者的term</p><p>大致思路就是这样，接下来开始具体实现</p><hr><h3 id="定义raft结构"><a href="#定义raft结构" class="headerlink" title="定义raft结构"></a>定义raft结构</h3><p>在A中其实不需要做的特别麻烦，按照上图的定义直接加就行</p><figure class="highlight pgsql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs pgsql"><span class="hljs-keyword">type</span> Raft struct &#123;<br>mu        sync.Mutex<br>peers     []*labrpc.ClientEnd<br>persister *tester.Persister<br>me        <span class="hljs-type">int</span><br>currentTerm <span class="hljs-type">int</span><br>votedFor <span class="hljs-type">int</span><br>state <span class="hljs-type">int</span><br>heartBeatTime <span class="hljs-type">time</span>.Time<br>electionTime  <span class="hljs-type">time</span>.Time<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>总体而言很直观，但是需要制定两个时间。<br><code>heartBeatTime</code>用于计算最迟收到心跳的时间，如果超时未收到，则开始计算选举时间<br><code>electionTime</code>用于计算从follow变为candidate且请求投票的时间</p><h3 id="GetState"><a href="#GetState" class="headerlink" title="GetState"></a>GetState</h3><p>这个没什么好说的，返回当前term和判断是否为leader就行了。不过我这里偷懒定义0为follow，1为candidate，2为leader</p><h3 id="RequestVote-RPC"><a href="#RequestVote-RPC" class="headerlink" title="RequestVote RPC"></a>RequestVote RPC</h3><p>和fig2一样，直接定义</p><figure class="highlight elm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs elm"><span class="hljs-keyword">type</span> <span class="hljs-type">RequestVoteArgs</span> struct &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Term</span> int <br>    <span class="hljs-type">CandidateId</span> int <br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight elm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs elm"><span class="hljs-keyword">type</span> <span class="hljs-type">RequestVoteReply</span> struct &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Term</span> int<br>    <span class="hljs-type">VoteGranted</span> bool<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>剩下的就是请求投票了<br>也非常简单，根据图中描述，candidate发送自己的任期和id供参考</p><ul><li>候选人任期小于接受人的任期，说明候选人落后，自己更新任期后变为，并且收到不予投票</li><li>等于，并且该follow没有投票<code>votedfor == -1</code>或等于自己的id，则收到投票</li><li>小于，更新该follow的任期</li></ul><h3 id="心跳机制"><a href="#心跳机制" class="headerlink" title="心跳机制"></a>心跳机制</h3><p>这一块比较困难，一是因为根据原文很琐碎，二是没有给出具体的编码模板。<br>先实现通信结构</p><figure class="highlight elm"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs elm"><span class="hljs-keyword">type</span> <span class="hljs-type">AppendEntriesArgs</span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Term</span>         int<br>    <span class="hljs-type">LeaderId</span>     int<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Entries</span>      []int<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">type</span> <span class="hljs-type">AppendEntriesReply</span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Term</span>    int<br>    <span class="hljs-type">Success</span> bool<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>心跳Rpc:<code>AppendEntries</code></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><figcaption><span>(rf *Raft) AppendEntries(args *AppendEntriesArgs,reply *AppendEntriesReply)&#123;</span></figcaption><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs func"><br>    rf.mu.Lock()//发送心跳<br><br>    defer rf.mu.Unlock()<br><br>    if args.Term &lt; rf.currentTerm &#123;<br><br>        reply.Success = false<br><br>        reply.Term = rf.currentTerm<br><br>        return<br><br>    &#125;//leader任期小于follow任期，说明失效<br><br>    if rf.state == 1 &amp;&amp; rf.currentTerm == args.Term&#123;<br><br>        rf.state = 0<br><br>    &#125;//接受方为candicate则回退到follow<br><br>    if args.Term &gt; rf.currentTerm &#123;<br><br>        rf.currentTerm = args.Term<br><br>        if rf.state == 1 || rf.state == 2 &#123;<br><br>          rf.state = 0<br><br>       &#125;<br><br>    &#125;<br><br>    reply.Term = rf.currentTerm<br><br>    reply.Success = true<br><br>    rf.resetElectionTime()//成功接受心跳就重置选举时间<br><br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>遍历节点调用发送心跳<code>speardAppendEntries</code></p><figure class="highlight roboconf"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs roboconf">func (rf *Raft) speardAppendEntries()&#123;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-attribute">rf.mu.Lock()</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute"></span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">    term</span> := rf<span class="hljs-variable">.currentTerm</span><br><br>    leaderId := rf<span class="hljs-variable">.me</span><br><br>    rf<span class="hljs-variable">.resetHeartBeatTime</span>()<br><br>    rf<span class="hljs-variable">.mu</span><span class="hljs-variable">.Unlock</span>()<br><br>    for i := 0; <span class="hljs-attribute">i &lt; len(rf.peers) ;i ++&#123;</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute"></span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">        if i == rf.me&#123;</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute"></span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">            continue</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute"></span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">        &#125;</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute"></span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">                args</span> := AppendEntriesArgs&#123;<br><br>            Term : term,<br><br>            LeaderId: leaderId,<br><br>        &#125;<br><br>        go func(peer int)&#123;<br><br>            reply := AppendEntriesReply&#123;&#125;<br><br>            ok := rf<span class="hljs-variable">.sendAppendEntries</span>(peer, &amp;args, &amp;reply)<br><br>            if ok &#123;<br><br>          rf<span class="hljs-variable">.mu</span><span class="hljs-variable">.Lock</span>()<br><br>          defer rf<span class="hljs-variable">.mu</span><span class="hljs-variable">.Unlock</span>()<br><br>          if reply<span class="hljs-variable">.Term</span> &gt; rf<span class="hljs-variable">.currentTerm</span> &#123;<br><br>              rf<span class="hljs-variable">.currentTerm</span> = reply<span class="hljs-variable">.Term</span><br><br>              rf<span class="hljs-variable">.state</span> = 0<br><br>              rf<span class="hljs-variable">.votedFor</span> = -1<br><br>              rf<span class="hljs-variable">.resetElectionTime</span>()<br><br>                &#125;<br><br>            &#125;<br><br>        &#125;(i)<br><br>    &#125;<br><br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
